    "user_request_original": "Design a 24-layer planar dielectric coating on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence from air to substrate: HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand), HfO2, SiO2 (Lemarchand). Optimize all 24 individual layer thicknesses in nanometers. Wavelength bands: maximize reflectance in 300-450 nm, maximize transmittance in 1000-1700 nm. Angle of incidence: 0 degrees (normal incidence). Polarization: unpolarized. Materials: hfo2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) from catalog. Total layer count fixed at 24. Minimum individual layer thickness: 20 nm. Maximum individual layer thickness: 200 nm. Objective: maximize weighted sum of mean reflectance (300-450 nm) and mean transmittance (1000-1700 nm) with equal weighting.",
